<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4052"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 12, 2005 - 5:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->NEW clues given by the english psychic Dennis Mckennzie &#40;some confirmed says DM&#41; in audio files <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/chat.html" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/chat.html</a> . He says about the Nancy Fox case: <BR> <BR>BTK knew her in adwance, probably from the construction company she worked at, &#40;Anyone knows the name of the company? PLEASE POST IT if you know?&#41; <BR> <BR>BTK sexually assulted Nancy Fox &#40;analsex&#41; and Mckennzie says that it was confirmed in a letter that BTK has sent to WPD. <BR> <BR>BTK let on the cold faucet to make his hands icecold so that it would fit his poem &#34;oh death&#34; line &#34;icecold hands&#34;. <BR> <BR>BTK also took a christmas present at NF´s home before leaving, and it was a doll &#40;i guess the one  Tom Voight had on his front page a while ago&#41;. <BR> <BR>BTK left in a blue van with a sunshine-logo on it &#40;Coleman had a sunshine-logo on their lamp products. Here is a link to a picture of the logo, it is nr 8 picture: <BR><a href="http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:6U6OT3XmjMAJ:terrence.marsh.faculty.noctrl.edu/lantern/colelantpre31.htm%2B%22Coleman%2B%22%2B%2Bwichita%2B%2Bsunshine%2B%2Blogo&amp;hl=en" target=_top>http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:6U6OT3XmjMAJ:t errence.marsh.faculty.noctrl.edu/lantern/colelantp re31.htm&#43;%22Coleman&#43;%22&#43;%2Bwichita&#43;%2Bsunshine&#43;%2B logo&amp;hl=en</a> <BR>Wonder if they had that logo on their vans and they were blue? <BR> <BR>Here is anoher link connecting the sunshine logo to  Wichita Coleman. <BR><a href="http://groups.google.dk/groups?q=%22sunshine%2Bof%2Bthe%2Bnight%22%2B%2Bwichita&amp;hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;safe=off&amp;selm=78Pa9.18%24jH2.25951%40newsfeed.slurp.net&amp;rnum=1" target=_top>http://groups.google.dk/groups?q=%22sunshine&#43;of&#43;th e&#43;night%22&#43;%2Bwichita&amp;hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;safe=off&amp;selm=78Pa 9.18%24jH2.25951%40newsfeed.slurp.net&amp;rnum=1</a> <BR> <BR>I  also add som info on the NF case that i havent seen/read before. <BR> <BR>Her is som interesting but horrible info about the state Nancy Foxs´s body was in. <BR><a href="http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:4wU4GKJ1F3oJ:www.francesfarmersrevenge.com/stuff/serialkillers/btk.htm%2B%22%2Bcoleman%2BCo.%2B%2B%2B%22%2B%2B%22nancy%2Bfox%22%2B%2Bconstruction&amp;hl=en" target=_top>http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:4wU4GKJ1F3oJ:w ww.francesfarmersrevenge.com/stuff/serialkillers/b tk.htm&#43;%22&#43;coleman&#43;Co.&#43;&#43;&#43;%22&#43;%2B%22nancy&#43;fox%22&#43;%2 Bconstruction&amp;hl=en</a> <BR>Painful memories <BR>News that BTK was back left families of his victims reeling. Dale Fox broke down Thursday when film of his daughter&#39;s home flashed on television during a news report.  Fox was at work when police arrived to tell him about his daughter&#39;s death. They had learned of Nancy Fox&#39;s slaying after her killer called police to claim credit. When Dale Fox identified the body at the hospital, it was so bruised it was hard to recognize his daughter.  &#34;I feel so sorry for him because it was such a brutal murder,&#34; said Ruth Fox, Nancy Fox&#39;s stepmother, of her husband. &#34;Had it been somebody who had just shot or stabbed her to death, but to brutally murder someone like BTK has done to his victims, I have no mercy for him at all.&#34;  The family has always made it a practice to keep its doors and windows locked, Ruth Fox said. Now that BTK has resurfaced, they plan to install an alarm system. <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
